## @haus-fmt/geo for Roc: the module is generated from schema.haus
## (roc/examples/gen.sh), the same schema as for every other language. Wgs84
## and Wgs84BBox are the codecs of the wgs84 profile (../profiles/wgs84.md).
package [HausFmtGeo, Wgs84, Wgs84BBox] { haus: "../../../roc/package/main.roc" }
